<p>My God, another story of Moose posted some weeks after the previous ? What an insane person.</p>
<p>OK, more seriously, I like this story. I don't know if there's a in-universe reason of why we suddenly became multiple persons, but I think it's an original way to tell the story (I really didn't see any stories like that in the Wiki).</p>
<p>The dialogues seems really realistic, the characters looks really human, even in silly moments. Even when it's goddamn Alto Clef. It has some strange moments, silly moments, &quot;serious-business&quot; moments&#8230;</p>
<p>In fact, I think I will re-read it when I will be in my home because right now, I'm in my university, people talk and I feel that I'm not in the exact proper conditions to enjoy the story. But right now, it's already a good piece.</p>
<p>Everyone who wrote entries on this piece, you can take a +1. I had one for each of you.</p>
<p><strong>P.S :</strong> Moose, if you see that, just a little question : this story heavily involves the &quot;mythos&quot; and fashion of the <em>Resurrection</em> canon, does this story belongs to it ? And if it belongs, can I put it in the hub for you if it's not done before ?</p>

